   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Franklin Roosevelt proposed the Court packing plan in 1937 because he",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1172743,
     "content_html": "was facing a tough reelection campaign in the fall"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172744,
     "content_html": "had just won a huge electoral majority"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172742,
     "content_html": "faced strong opposition in Congress for his New Deal legislative agenda"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172741,
     "content_html": "had overwhelming support in state and lower federal courts for his New Deal programs"
    }
